The generators in src/mambahifigan/ are derived from SpeechBrain's HiFi-GAN implementation at commit
637f0a55 (speechbrain/lobes/models/HifiGAN.py). ResBlock1, ResBlock2 and LRELU_SLOPE are imported from
SpeechBrain unchanged; OriginalHifiganGenerator is a verbatim copy of SpeechBrain's HifiganGenerator under
a different name.

overlay/speechbrain/lobes/models/HifiGAN.py is SpeechBrain's file with this project's additions applied, kept
as the archival record of the code that produced the reported runs.

HiFi-GAN is from Kong, Kim and Bae, "HiFi-GAN: Generative Adversarial Networks for Efficient and High
Fidelity Speech Synthesis", NeurIPS 2020.

Mamba is from Gu and Dao, "Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces", 2024. The
Mamba2 implementation used here is from the mamba-ssm package (https://github.com/state-spaces/mamba),
Apache-2.0.

The LJSpeech dataset (https://keithito.com/LJ-Speech-Dataset/) is in the public domain. The audio samples
under docs/assets/audio/ are model outputs and reconstructions derived from it.
